%% Guo Feeder UI v1 —— 命令交互与幂等
%% 关键点：一次点击 = 一个 cmd_id，重试复用同一 id，绝不换新 id 重发危险操作
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Editing: 用户点按
    Editing --> Confirming: 风险 H / C
    Editing --> Submitting: 风险 S / M（关阀·查询）

    Confirming --> [*]: 取消
    Confirming --> Submitting: 确认（800ms 后可点）

    Submitting --> Rejected: 4xx / 5xx
    Submitting --> Published: Worker 200（EMQX 已接受）
    Submitting --> SubmitUnknown: 网络中断 / 10s 超时

    Published --> DeviceAcked: c:"ack"
    Published --> NoAck: 15s 内无 ack

    DeviceAcked --> Queued: s=1 "Action queued"
    DeviceAcked --> Failed: s!=0 且 s!=1
    Queued --> Succeeded: 终态 s=0
    Queued --> Failed: 终态 s!=0

    NoAck --> Expired: 再等 15s
    Queued --> Expired: 超过 timeout_ms 无终态
    SubmitUnknown --> Published: 复用同一 cmd_id 重试后收到回帧
    SubmitUnknown --> Rejected: 重试被拒

    Expired --> Unknown: 查不到设备状态
    Expired --> Succeeded: 查到"确实已生效"
    Expired --> Failed: 查到"确实没生效"

    Rejected --> [*]
    Succeeded --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Unknown --> [*]

    note right of Submitting
        cmd_id 在进入此状态前生成一次，
        之后整条链路（含重试）复用
    end note

    note right of Unknown
        危险操作（开阀/跑流程/秤清零）
        禁止自动重发；
        必须由用户"我已知晓，重新发起"，
        且新操作使用【新】cmd_id
    end note
